# Commit message style

Use Conventional Commits with a Chinese summary, matching recent history:

```
type(scope): 简短中文说明
```

## Types

- `feat` — new feature
- `fix` — bug fix
- `refactor` — restructuring without behavior change
- `chore` — build, tooling, non-product tweaks
- `docs` — documentation only
- `test` — tests only

## Scopes (common)

`app` · `viewport` · `rhi` · `render` · `io` · `modeling` · `view`

## Rules

- One line preferred; keep it under ~50 Chinese characters when possible
- Subject focuses on **why / user-visible outcome**, not a file list
- Use Chinese for the description after the colon (same as recent `main` history)
- Optional body: short bullets if multiple distinct changes must share one commit
- Do not use `--no-verify` or amend pushed commits unless explicitly asked

## Examples

```
feat(app): 增加欢迎首页与最近打开文件
fix(viewport): 修复着色/真实模式仍可见模型内部
feat(rhi): 实现 OpenGL 后端并对接 OCCT STEP/IGES/BREP
```
